{"t":"SJM","made":"2026-11-13 00:57","name":"The J. M. Smucker Company","ko":null,"sector":"Consumer Defensive","industry":"Packaged Foods","employees":null,"hq":"Orrville, OH, United States","website":"https://www.jmsmucker.com","summary_en":"The J. M. Smucker Company manufactures and markets branded food and beverage products worldwide. The company operates through five segments: U.S. Retail Coffee, U.S. Retail Frozen Handheld and Spreads, U.S. Retail Pet Foods, Sweet Baked Snacks, and Away From Home. It offers coffee, sweet baked goods, pet snacks, frozen handheld products, peanut butter, cat and dog food, fruit and specialty spreads, cookies, frozen sandwiches and snacks, hot beverages, portion control products, toppings and syrups, baking mixes and ingredients, and flour. The company provides its products under the Folgers, Café Bustelo, Dunkin', Jif, Smucker's, Uncrustables, Meow Mix, Milk-Bone, Pup-Peroni, Canine Carry Outs, Hostess, and 1850 brand names. It sells its products through direct sales and brokers to food retailers, club stores, discount and dollar stores, online retailers, pet specialty stores, distributors, drug stores, military commissaries, mass merchandisers, supermarket chains, national mass retailers, convenience stores, vending channels, and foodservice distributors and operators. The J. M. Smucker Company was founded in 1897 and is headquartered in Orrville, Ohio.","quote_type":"EQUITY","summary_ko":"J. M. Smucker Company는 전 세계적으로 브랜드 식품 및 음료 제품을 제조 및 판매합니다. 이 회사는 미국 소매 커피, 미국 소매 냉동 휴대용 및 스프레드, 미국 소매 애완동물 식품, Sweet Baked Snacks 및 Away From Home의 5개 부문을 통해 운영됩니다. 커피, 달콤한 제과류, 애완동물 스낵, 냉동 휴대용 제품, 땅콩 버터, 고양이 및 개 사료, 과일 및 특수 스프레드, 쿠키, 냉동 샌드위치 및 스낵, 뜨거운 음료, 부분 조절 제품, 토핑 및 시럽, 베이킹 믹스 및 재료, 밀가루를 제공합니다. 이 회사는 Folgers, Café Bustelo, Dunkin', Jif, Smucker's, Uncrustables, Meow Mix, Milk-Bone, Pup-Peroni, Canine Carry Outs, Hostess 및 1850 브랜드 이름으로 제품을 제공합니다. 직접 판매 및 중개인을 통해 식품 소매업체, 클럽 매장, 할인 및 달러 매장, 온라인 소매업체, 애완동물 전문 매장, 유통업체, 약국, 군수품 판매점, 대량 판매점, 슈퍼마켓 체인, 전국 대형 소매업체, 편의점, 판매 채널, 식품 서비스 유통업체 및 운영업체에 제품을 판매합니다. J. M. Smucker Company는 1897년에 설립되었으며 오하이오 주 오르빌에 본사를 두고 있습니다.","val":{"price":132.955,"mcap":14202676224.0,"pe":62.1285,"fpe":12.094559,"peg":null,"ps":1.5510354,"pb":2.4697218,"ev_ebitda":9.325,"div":3.37,"beta":0.252,"hi52":136.22,"lo52":88.25},"fin":{"rev":9156899840.0,"rev_g":0.05,"eps_g":null,"gross":0.37951002,"op":0.18556,"net":0.02506,"roe":0.03931,"fcf":1464337536.0,"cash":43200000.0,"debt":6940199936.0,"de":120.682,"eps":2.14,"feps":10.99296},"own":{"short":0.030199999,"inst":0.91678,"insider":0.02256},"analyst":{"n":16,"mean":141.8125,"median":145.0,"high":160.0,"low":120.0,"rec":"none","recMean":null,"trend":[{"index":0,"period":"0m","strongBuy":3,"buy":7,"hold":9,"sell":0,"strongSell":0},{"index":1,"period":"-1m","strongBuy":3,"buy":7,"hold":9,"sell":0,"strongSell":0},{"index":2,"period":"-2m","strongBuy":3,"buy":7,"hold":9,"sell":0,"strongSell":0},{"index":3,"period":"-3m","strongBuy":3,"buy":7,"hold":9,"sell":0,"strongSell":0}]},"changes":[{"GradeDate":"2026-10-16","Firm":"Barclays","ToGrade":"Equal-Weight","FromGrade":"Equal-Weight","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Lowers","currentPriceTarget":137.0,"priorPriceTarget":145.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-10-15","Firm":"Bernstein","ToGrade":"Outperform","FromGrade":"Outperform","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Raises","currentPriceTarget":160.0,"priorPriceTarget":157.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-08-27","Firm":"Barclays","ToGrade":"Equal-Weight","FromGrade":"Equal-Weight","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Raises","currentPriceTarget":145.0,"priorPriceTarget":125.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-08-27","Firm":"TD Cowen","ToGrade":"Hold","FromGrade":"Hold","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Raises","currentPriceTarget":136.0,"priorPriceTarget":123.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-08-27","Firm":"Bernstein","ToGrade":"Outperform","FromGrade":"Outperform","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Raises","currentPriceTarget":157.0,"priorPriceTarget":137.0},{"GradeDate":"2026